//MCQs

::Spark-RDD::
Which of the following is not a way to create Spark RDD?{
    ~ Using parallelize() method
    ~ By applying transformation on existing RDD.
    = By applying transformation on SparkSQL
    ~ From existing Dataframe using ".rdd" operation. 
}

::Spark-RDD::
Which of the following statement is wrong regarding RDDs in Spark?{
    ~ RDDs are the fundamental data structure of Spark.
    = RDDs are mutable.
    ~ RDDs are fault tolerant
    ~ RDDs are distributed.
}

::Spark-RDD::
Which method is used to create an Array RDD in Spark?{
    ~ parallel()
    ~ parallelized()
    ~ Array()
    = parallelize()
}

::Spark-RDD::
Which of the following code is the correct representation of creating the Spark RDD in Scala?{
    = val rdd \= sc.parallelize(Array(1, 2, 3))
    ~ var rdd \= sc.parallelize(Array(1, 2, 3))
    ~ val rdd \= parallelize(1, 2, 3)
    ~ val rdd \= parallelize(array(1, 2, 3))
}
